=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# users screen-ubuntu2604 --------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Mock: User Management. web-01.example.net runs Ubuntu 26.04$
# with sudo-rs 0.2.13, as the VM: debian13's accounts,$
# /etc/sudoers with %admin as well as %sudo, HOME_MODE 0750.$
$
# User Management ##############################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, sudo$
$
# george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Sudo                 Enabled, No password$
   -  Granted by           /etc/sudoers.d/90-cloud-init-users$
   -  SSH Keys             2 keys$
   -  Password             None$
$
# alice --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] Sudo                 Enabled$
   -  Granted by           group sudo$
  [ ] SSH Keys             None$
   -  Password             Set$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Manage User          Configure sudo, SSH keys$
   2) Create User          Configure a new user$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-2 or q]:$
$
$

